<title>UK: Allied Domecq year pretax profits slip.</title>
<headline>Allied Domecq year pretax profits slip.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending August 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) (basic)	33.1		 vs    38.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   14.15		vs   n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   23.59		vs    27.6</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-exceps	 575		  vs   645</p>
<p> Turnover		   5,370		  vs 6,107</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax, pre-exceptional profits were in a range of 560 to 581 million stg.</p>
<p>The drinks company said exceptional losses for the year totalled 311 million stg.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 701		    vs 692</p>
<p> Loss on disposals	311		    vs 51</p>
<p> Finance charges	  154		    vs 170</p>
<p> Tax			  174		    vs 245</p>
<p> Net taxed		  90		     vs 259</p>
<p> Retained		   203 loss	     vs 88 loss</p>
<p> Pay date		   February 21, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  December 10  Ex-div date		December 2</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
